    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Plate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Tom, Cornelius, and Cabb! \u2014 A fiery tomato with a knack for reaching high places, a clever ear of corn who launches kernels with pinpoint accuracy, and a strong, gentle cabbage with a heart of gold. Trapped in a sprawling food processing plant, this unlikely trio must combine their talents to leap, swing, and smash their way through a maze of deadly machinery, perilous platforms, and creeping threats. Teamwork is their only hope as they solve tricky puzzles, avoid unseen dangers, and face off against more than just machines \u2014 These challenges will test more than just their roots. The factory isn\u2019t empty\u2026 and getting out won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can this veggie trio make it out before they\u2019re turned into someone's next meal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Plate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Tom, Cornelius, and Cabb! \u2014 A fiery tomato with a knack for reaching high places, a clever ear of corn who launches kernels with pinpoint accuracy, and a strong, gentle cabbage with a heart of gold. Trapped in a sprawling food processing plant, this unlikely trio must combine their talents to leap, swing, and smash their way through a maze of deadly machinery, perilous platforms, and creeping threats. Teamwork is their only hope as they solve tricky puzzles, avoid unseen dangers, and face off against more than just machines \u2014 These challenges will test more than just their roots. The factory isn\u2019t empty\u2026 and getting out won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can this veggie trio make it out before they\u2019re turned into someone's next meal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Three unlikely heroes\u2014 a fiery tomato, a clever ear of corn, and a strong cabbage \u2014 must combine their unique skills to escape a dangerous food processing plant! Leap, swing, and smash through puzzles, hazards, and hidden threats before they end up on the plate. It\u2019s time to Escape the Plate!",
